  "note": "Port-level answers: an identity's default configuration set name (absent when it has none) and each set's destinations reduced to name, enabled, eventBridge and matchingEventTypes. No identity defaults to a lane-map set, and fothering-bulk has one enabled EventBridge destination that covers all six event types.",
